"""Learning stages and topics for a beginner AI/ML TPM growing into a senior, technically focused AI/ML TPM.

Stages run from basics to intermediate to advanced. Each topic has: gist,
purpose (why it matters for a TPM), a plain-words explanation, an example,
three insights, two experiments to try, three timed next steps, one metric to
track, the best resources (keys into resources.RESOURCES) and three quiz
questions. All text is original.
"""

REVIEWED = "14 October 2026"

